    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just a lot to take in. i guess i'm more concerned about how to handle it if they bring up the idea that gender is actually a social construct or that it's not tied to biology. i want to be progressive and inclusive, but i also want to be grounded in reality. what's the \"right\" way to guide a child through those specific concepts without making things confusing?",
